BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2f2b177f-5aae-3f93-ae1b-1fd50d1ef584.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
